import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 323 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Series Summary: The Ultimate Limit of Oligarchic Civilization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 323 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Series Summary: The Ultimate Limit of Oligarchic Civilization","no":323,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Series Summary","Oligarchic Civilization","Ultimate Limit","Heng Yuan Zhou"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0323_模块2-遮天-系列总结.md","filePath":"en/0323_模块2-遮天-系列总结.md"}'),a={name:"en/0323_模块2-遮天-系列总结.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,d,c){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-323-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-series-summary-the-ultimate-limit-of-oligarchic-civilization" tabindex="-1">Entry 323 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Series Summary: The Ultimate Limit of Oligarchic Civilization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-323-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-series-summary-the-ultimate-limit-of-oligarchic-civilization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 323 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Series Summary: The Ultimate Limit of Oligarchic Civilization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 36 · Summary) | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 03, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-thirty-six-entries-of-decomposition-finally-land-on-one-sentence" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Thirty-six entries of decomposition finally land on one sentence <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-thirty-six-entries-of-decomposition-finally-land-on-one-sentence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Thirty-six entries of decomposition finally land on one sentence&quot;">​</a></h2><p>All six top-level axioms present: anti-predation, republicanism of Myriad Races, collective ascension, causal self-discipline, law-first — among which the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> is the thread running through the whole series. As the summary of the full Shrouding-the-Heavens decomposition, this entry converges the 36 entries (288–323) into one sentence: <strong>oligarchic civilization bets civilization&#39;s fate on a group of strong ones; these people present = civilization present; these people gone = civilization in chaos.</strong> Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy wastes repeatedly pointed out across the series, converged:</p><ul><li>Cosmos-tier aptitude used for one person&#39;s Dao realization (289)</li><li>Emperor lifespan idling in closed-doors emperor-contention (289, 297)</li><li>Suppression energy zeroing with personal death (290, 310)</li><li>Demon-race, women, poor-family talents structurally wasted (301, 303, 304)</li><li>Individual immortality making resources an eternal black hole (320)</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Regression mechanisms diagnosed across the series:</p><ol><li>Emperor nirvana = dark turmoil (290, 296)</li><li>Eternal peace surnamed Ye, institutions not established (298)</li><li>Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families&#39; knowledge monopoly, class solidification (300)</li><li>Immortalization road zero-sum, cosmic battlefield zero-sum (318, 319)</li><li>Causal self-discipline absent, history changeable (322)</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Layer-by-layer anatomy of Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking:</p><ul><li>Holy Physique path devours monopolized resources (291)</li><li>Physique privilege, opportunity zero-sum, Dao legacies hidden (291, 299)</li><li>Overthrowing old families but becoming a new oligarch (300, 298)</li><li>Civilization weight crushing Myriad-Rank consensus (321)</li><li>Pursuing individual immortality rather than collective ascension (320)</li></ul><p>Ye Fan is not a villain, but he stands at the ceiling of the predatory system, never overturning the underlying law and rewriting it.</p><p>Finally, the 36-entry Shrouding decomposition wants to leave readers a judgment standard: from now on, when reading any Myriad-Realms web novel, do not rush to judge whether the protagonist is strong or exciting; first ask three questions — first, if the protagonist is gone, what happens to the world? Second, do Myriad Ranks have a say of their own? Third, can the rules be willfully modified by the author? Heng Yuan Zhou has already answered these three questions for you. Shrouding-the-Heavens is a good novel, but it is not a good civilization — and what Heng Yuan Zhou wants to do is take all those &quot;not-good-enough civilizations&quot; in good novels and one by one transform them into homes where Myriad Ranks can live in peace.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alternative-solution matrix given across the series:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Illness</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Prescription</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Emperor dictatorship</td><td>Anchor Council four-powers separation (308)</td></tr><tr><td>Realm inflation</td><td>Nine-realms-plus-two stable framework (309)</td></tr><tr><td>Dark turmoil</td><td>Alaya supervision (312)</td></tr><tr><td>Human centeredness</td><td>Myriad Races republicanism (313)</td></tr><tr><td>Zero-sum predation</td><td>Develop increment Origin (318, 319)</td></tr><tr><td>Causal disturbance</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom (322)</td></tr><tr><td>Individual immortality</td><td>Collective ascension (320)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The essence of the alternative: change &quot;peace Ye Fan watches over&quot; into &quot;peace Myriad Ranks themselves own.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Series-wide review conclusions consolidated:</p><ul><li>Within a millennium of Ye Fan&#39;s absence, turmoil recurrence probability ≈ 92% (310)</li><li>After injecting symbiotic institutions, turmoil drops to zero (311, 312)</li><li>Myriad-Rank governance participation from &lt;5% to &gt;60% (311, 313)</li><li>Mid-low strong-one success rate rises several times (311)</li><li>Knowledge-transmission rate from 30% to 95%+ (311)</li></ul><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Series-wide overall review:</p><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong> (early layering fine, late inflation, crossover fighting)</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong> (realm inflation, trilogy crossover, Red-Dust Immortal vagueness)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong> (oligarchic — lower than Gu Chensha&#39;s single-log, higher than Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s networked)</li></ul><p>The 36-entry decomposition wants to emphasize at the end: Heng Yuan Zhou criticizes Shrouding not to deny a good novel, but to extract civilization-design lessons from good novels. Ye Fan&#39;s story has moved tens of millions of readers; this itself proves his personal charisma; but personal charisma cannot replace institutions. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to do is transform Ye Fan&#39;s emotion of &quot;one person guarding the mortal realm&quot; into the institution of &quot;Myriad Ranks together guarding the mortal realm&quot; — so that emotion need not depend on one person&#39;s existence, and peace need not bear the surname Ye. This is the best memorial to Ye Fan.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: triple waste of cosmos-tier aptitude, lifespan, suppression energy, item-by-item anatomized across the series</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Ye Fan stands at the predatory system&#39;s ceiling, never overturning the underlying law</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Ye Fan = medium / oligarchic; Tang Luo = high / bestowed; Gu Chensha = extreme / single-log; Heng Yuan Zhou = extremely low / networked — Shrouding is precisely the middle gear, &quot;not as good as the upper, better than the lower&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: demon race, women, poor families, Myriad-Rank branches all marginalized under oligarchic structure; Heng Yuan Zhou uses Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage as alternative</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Shrouding&#39;s zero-sum cosmos and causal chaos are intrinsically distant from a symbiotic cosmos that can infinitely expand cross-multiverse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shrouding-the-Heavens used over a million words to tell a sufficiently exciting story: a man named Ye Fan, from obscurity to Red-Dust Immortal, guarded his era. But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment ultimately is not on whether the story is exciting, but on whether civilization is stable.</p><p>The answer is: not stable enough. Because peace bears the surname Ye, it may end with Ye at any time; because the Great Dao is privately hidden, it may break with strong ones&#39; nirvana; because of zero-sum predation, war may break out anytime quotas are scarce.</p><p>The ultimate limit of oligarchic civilization is not being not strong enough, but being strong too accidentally — all its good things are bet on &quot;those few people are still present.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou does not want accidental golden ages, but inevitable peace. This, is the ultimate divide between solitary Dao and symbiosis.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · series summary described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./288_模块2-遮天-总论叶凡孤道与寡头式文明.html">Entry 288 · Overview</a> · <a href="./307_模块2-遮天-叶凡vs衡元宙.html">Entry 307 · Ye Fan vs. Heng Yuan Zhou</a> · <a href="./311_模块2-遮天-制度替代收益.html">Entry 311 · Institutional Alternative Benefit</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',36)])])}const g=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
